{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Aquanore is a <strong>relaxing aquarium idle game</strong>\u2014perfect for opening, breathing in, and letting time do the work. <strong>Collect species</strong>, <strong>level up fish</strong>, <strong>earn passive income</strong> as they swim, and <strong>sell high-value fish</strong> to boost your economy. With <strong>decorations and floor tiles</strong>, your tank reflects <strong>your style</strong>\u2014from minimalist zen to vibrant reef.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch the fishs swimming between the decorations and relax...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086860/extras/87c7f8d53c4cf8250a63c23e4fbd1b59.poster.avif?t=1773879764\" width=912 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086860/extras/87c7f8d53c4cf8250a63c23e4fbd1b59.webm?t=1773879764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086860/extras/87c7f8d53c4cf8250a63c23e4fbd1b59.mp4?t=1773879764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect bizarre creatures never seen before.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086860/extras/7d58a51ec25ce99976cf5065edec9ca8.poster.avif?t=1773879764\" width=776 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086860/extras/7d58a51ec25ce99976cf5065edec9ca8.webm?t=1773879764\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086860/extras/7d58a51ec25ce99976cf5065edec9ca8.mp4?t=1773879764\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you watch, fish <strong>gain XP</strong>, <strong>level up</strong>, generate income over time, and <strong>increase their sell value</strong>. Discover new species, complete your <strong>Fish Book</strong>, and celebrate each rarity with satisfying rewards. Sit back and enjoy the <strong>gentle water effects</strong> and <strong>day\u2013night cycle</strong>\u2014Aquanore is built to unwind.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Idle Progression</strong> \u2013 Fish earn money passively; play for minutes or hours and always make progress.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Collection &amp; Rarities</strong> \u2013 Multiple species with <strong>rarity stars</strong> and unique stats. The rarer, the stronger the potential.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Automatic Growth</strong> \u2013 Fish <strong>gain XP</strong>, <strong>level up</strong>, and <strong>become more valuable</strong> over time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Growing Economy</strong> \u2013 <strong>Buy eggs</strong>, <strong>sell fish</strong>, invest in <strong>upgrades</strong>, and watch your income scale.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fish Book (Encyclopedia)</strong> \u2013 Track discoveries, <strong>highest level per species</strong>, and <strong>total earnings</strong> generated.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep Personalization</strong> \u2013 <strong>Decorations and floor tiles</strong> to craft your dream tank; drag, place, and compose your scene.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086860?t=1773879764","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4086860?t=1773879764","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4086860/4cc